# Public job-board tokens for ATS adapters. None of these are required.
# Leave a value blank to disable the corresponding source.
#
# Example:
# JOBSEARCH_GREENHOUSE_BOARD=acme
# JOBSEARCH_LEVER_BOARD=acme
# JOBSEARCH_ASHBY_BOARD=acme
#
# Override the SQLite location (defaults to ~/.jobsearch/state.db):
# JOBSEARCH_DB=/path/to/state.db